g solutions and print materials accessible through a range of mediums. The International segment offers digital and print solutions in approximately 100 countries and 80 languages outside of the United States. The company was formerly known as Mav Holding Corporation and changed its name to McGraw Hill, Inc. in October 2022. The company was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Columbus, Ohio. McGraw Hill, Inc. operates as a subsidiary of Pe Mav Holdings, Llc."}}